                                        "entry_id": "dc12dd73-6d24-3233-9b88-12f7cb313f93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pungent, acrid, poisonous liquid aldehyde, CH₂=CH-CH=O, made by the destructive distillation of glycerol."
